        "metadata": {
          "category": "stories",
          "minAge": 3,
          "maxAge": 8,
          "media": {
            "duration": 7263,
            "fileSize": 44512455
          },
          "author": "Moshi",
          "description": "Learn to Fly with Moshi Airlines: Enjoy a dreamy, calming flight with Moshi Airlines as your captain describes the wonders of air travel. \n\nFlumpy's Tremendous Trampoline Trip: Follow Flumpy as he boings around the Moshi world in this mega-sleepy journey featuring mesmerizing trampoline sounds. \n\nHoney's Jump Rope Journey: One of Moshi’s sleepiest stories ever, this dreamy tale features the soothing sound of a bunny jumping rope as she skips home to Pawberry Fields through the Moshi countryside.  \n\nBusling's Windshield Wiper Wonderland: All aboard for this magical twilight journey starring a little Moshling bus who loves drifting and dreaming to the soothing sound of his wonderful windshield wipers. \n\nFlying with Fluttercup: Take a sleepy flight through the stars, to a magical land beyond the rainbow, as you ride with Fluttercup, one of the most majestic unicorns in the Moshi swooniverse.",
          "audioPreviewUrl": "https://audio-previews-media.api.yotoplay.com/audio-previews/6cf89344938084f1b92219093d02902dd188ec2aaf672f74a5a482d7c8844d80/LpxU-R2fnT9Ic5T5PXxgEhxJBlAJ317tPyCLYjoYuuk.mp3",
